  "title": "AGTTM Part 1 - Introduction",
  "abstract": "AGTTM Part 1 establishes the foundational framework and principles for temporary traffic management across Australia and New Zealand. It defines key terminology, roles, and responsibilities that underpin the entire AGTTM series. The document introduces the safe system approach and hierarchy of controls as fundamental concepts for protecting road users and workers during temporary traffic management activities. It outlines the relationship between AGTTM and other standards including AS 1742.3, providing context for how the series integrates with existing regulatory frameworks.",
